{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":245995,"duration_api_ms":314993,"num_turns":19,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"31570f5a-f002-4dec-ad6c-25dc1c1b2178","total_cost_usd":1.4602937999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":1195,"cache_creation_input_tokens":101855,"cache_read_input_tokens":791035,"output_tokens":6674,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":101855,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":3277,"outputTokens":13801,"cacheReadInputTokens":429268,"cacheCreationInputTokens":112119,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.25535755000000004,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":1195,"outputTokens":6674,"cacheReadInputTokens":791035,"cacheCreationInputTokens":101855,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.20493625,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"conditionally_approved","evidence":["All 37 unit tests pass across tank_scenarios (geometry_scaling: 18, materialization: 11, startup_overrides: 5, lib: 3) with no failures.","All 3 e2e integration tests pass (geometry_1x_vs_2x_stocked_metrics, mismatched_filter, nano_vs_standard_vs_large) in crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_geometry_scaling.rs.","All 3 substrate O2 penetration regression tests pass (zero_penetration_depth_remains_a_valid_computed_boundary, negative_penetration_depth_uses_the_uncomputed_sentinel, anoxic_water_yields_zero_penetration_and_positive_suboxic_volume).","Clippy passes with zero warnings on tank_core, tank_scenarios, and tank_harness.","Scaling constants are fully documented with rationale: FILTER_FLOW_TURNOVERS_PER_HOUR=10.0, HEATER_WATTS_PER_LITER=0.75 (cap 1.0), PLANT_BIOMASS_G_PER_1000_CM2_FOOTPRINT=3.0, AUTO_STOCK range 0.15-0.25 adults/L, MICROBE_REFERENCE_FOOTPRINT_CM2=1000.0.","scale_hardware_to_geometry() (lib.rs:593-630) scales filter flow, filter media, heater watts (via recommended_heater_max_watts), and microbe biomass with documented formulas.","build_plant_guilds() (lib.rs:999-1038) scales per-guild biomass as footprint_cm2 * 3.0 / 1000.0, floored at 1.0g.","recommended_auto_stock_adults_per_liter() (lib.rs:89-93) implements volume-dependent density ramp (0.15-0.25/L over 0-150L).","combined_100l_scaling_produces_expected_hardware_and_biomass test (geometry_scaling.rs:552) verifies 100L produces filter ~1000 lph, heater ~75W, and plant biomass ~15g.","The size-dependent feed multiplier (size_scale.powf(2.5).min(2.0)) was removed per final review amendment; line 168 now uses constant per-adult feeding.","Substrate O2 penetration correctly uses -1.0 sentinel (UNCOMPUTED_O2_PENETRATION_DEPTH_CM) for uninitialized state, preserving 0.0 as a valid computed boundary.","Explicit scenario-authored overrides win over auto-scaling at every level: filter media, heater preset, shrimp count, substrate, and plant selection (tested in startup_overrides.rs).","Mismatched-filter regression test confirms undersized filter (200 cm²) produces >1.5x higher nitrite peaks than auto-scaled setup.","Module docstring (e2e_geometry_scaling.rs:1-9) was updated to honestly state that concentration metrics need a wider band than the 20% target."],"findings_or_gaps":["CONCENTRATION_PARITY_TOLERANCE remains at 0.65 (65%) for peak TAN and DO range, versus the AC target of 20%. The module docstring and constant comment now document this honestly, but the AC itself says 'per-liter concentrations stay within 20% of each other over 500 hours' for cycling timeline, TAN peak, and DO range. Only cycle timeline and temperature meet 20%; TAN and DO get 65%. This is a model-level limitation (fixed substrate depth + footprint-scaled habitat creates non-linear carrying-capacity differences), not a code bug, but the AC is not fully met.","The nitrification_alkalinity.rs test file exists and is tracked in git, but the test functions do not match by the file name pattern (they have names like closed_system_alkalinity_mass_balance, soft_water_declines_faster_than_hard_water). This is fine for actual coverage but worth noting for discoverability.","CYCLE_TIMELINE_MATURITY_THRESHOLD = 0.04 is acknowledged as a weak cycling proxy in the outstanding risks. Stocked baselines cross it immediately, so the 'cycling completion hours' metric is measuring something closer to initial ramp-up speed than the classic cycling timeline. This weakens the cycle-timeline parity assertion, though the assertion still passes at 20%."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["Track the 65% concentration parity gap as follow-up work (likely in tanksim-6e5.5.7 or a new bead). The fix requires substrate-depth scaling or habitat-normalization changes so that per-liter carrying capacity stays constant across geometry scales. Until then, the 65% band is the honest enforcement threshold.","Consider raising CYCLE_TIMELINE_MATURITY_THRESHOLD above the 0.04 value so the cycling-completion metric reflects meaningful biofilter establishment rather than an immediate crossing. This would make the 20% cycle-timeline parity assertion more meaningful as a scaling regression signal.","The module docstring mismatch is resolved but the backlog bead's AC text still says 20% for all concentration metrics. If the bead is closed with this implementation, the bead's AC or a closing comment should acknowledge the 65% concentration-parity status to prevent confusion in tanksim-6e5.5.7."]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"8cef55db-4aa2-4b0f-b411-43208b69ad00"}
